...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: "사용자" { class: person }
ui: "화면" { class: ours }
runtime: "런타임" { class: ours }
server: "서버" { class: ours }
agent: "코디네이터" { class: ours }
openai: "OpenAI gpt-5.5" { class: ext }

user -> ui: 질문 입력
ui -> runtime: POST /api/copilotkit
runtime -> server: POST / (RunAgentInput)
server -> agent: 그래프 실행
agent -> openai: 모델 호출 (스트리밍)
openai -> agent: write_todos 호출
agent -> server: TOOL_CALL (write_todos)
server -> runtime: SSE 이벤트
runtime -> ui: 카드 · 계획 목록
agent -> server: TOOL_CALL_RESULT
agent -> openai: 모델 호출 (결과 담음)
openai -> agent: research 호출
agent -> server: TOOL_CALL (research)
